  "Are you a landlord? Do you love describing small rooms as cozy? Then come to Cozy Con. It's in a closet. It's very cozy. Fire code says four people.",
  "The Floorplan Video Uploader. It uploads floorplan videos. That's the name. We weren't trying to be clever. Somebody asked us to be clever and we said no.",
  "New Streamliner Photo Uploader Gold. It's the same uploader but you have to say Gold when you open it. Out loud. It knows if you don't.",
  "Tired of stairs? Try Dale's Ramp Barn. Every ramp is just a stair someone gave up on. Dale gave up a long time ago. Dale's Ramp Barn.",
  "This hour of M D F M is brought to you by a man named Craig, who will not tell us what he sells. He just pays us. Thank you, Craig.",
  "Cheryl's Wedding Videography. We film your wedding from inside a nearby car. You'll never know we're there. Your guests will. Cheryl's.",
  "Do you have a show pony? Does it need primping? Don't call us. We're a hardware store. We keep getting these calls. Please stop.",
