  "The new M D F M app is coming soon. It's the radio, but on your phone, but it's just a picture of a radio. You can't play it. It's a sticker, basically.",
  "Doug's Clapping Service is now available for birthdays. Doug will clap at the cake. Doug will clap at the candles. Doug will not leave after the party.",
  "Fly-B-Gone Junior. For kids. It's a spray bottle of water and a picture of a fly. The kids think they're helping. They are not helping.",
  "Approve-O-Matic. A stamp that says approved. Use it on anything. Rob cannot stop you. He can, actually. Please don't use it on the hub.",
  "Brought to you by the Activity bell. The number on it went up. It always goes up. That's what numbers do here.",
  "Grandpa Lou's Mattress and Fly Storage is now hiring. Must be good with mattresses. Must be okay with flies. Must not ask about the back room.",
  "Are your suggestions vague? Do you write things like make it better, and then leave? Claude will ask you three questions. You will answer one. Media Development Hub.",
  "Feeling unproductive? Here's a radio station inside your work app. You're welcome. We're also the problem.",
